queue_with_capacity_serve processes a list of events in which people arrive and the server serves up to some capacity at once, returning whichever people still wait in order after every event.

Since the arriving events only ever add people and the serving event only ever removes them from the front, the queue after each event is a prefix of the queue before it. Nothing removes a later-arriving person. So the final result is always a suffix of the list of arrived people.

